<newsitem itemid="194096" id="root" date="1996-11-15" xml:lang="en">
<title>FRANCE: Accor nine-month sales rise.</title>
<headline>Accor nine-month sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					21,136    vs   19,501</p>
<p>    - hotels					11,879    vs   10,508</p>
<p>    - business services			  6,169    vs    5,724</p>
<p>    - other activities			   3,089    vs    3,207</p>
<p>THIRD QUARTER</p>
<p>    Turnover					 7,296    vs    6,711</p>
<p>    - hotels					 4,213    vs    3,669</p>
<p>    - business services			  2,020    vs    1,913</p>
<p>    - other activities			   1,063    vs    1,129</p>
<p>NOTE - Accor gave the figures in the BALO official bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
